  "description": "Helia Bailey was born with the power to discern good from evil. The favor of her grandfather, King Alphonse, the oath of her childhood friend, the knight Levain, and the devotion of her maid, Eli... these were supposed to protect her. But with the king's death, everything began to unravel. The shadow of a great evil creeps in, and Eli's goodwill vanishes. To protect herself, Helia chose to become consumed by darkness herself. Soon, she came to be known as \"the most wicked woman in history.\" The most arrogant and greedy woman in the kingdom. And Levain, too, broke his oath without knowing the truth. Helia lost everything. But if she revealed the truth, the great evil would turn its attention to Levain. \"I will protect you, the light that you are.\" Even if it is a lonely path, even if my world sinks into darkness. Levain, I will protect you alone. Her epic tale now begins.\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=5785712)    \nOriginal Webtoon \n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://dbook.docomo.ne.jp/item/784ee853c70657a8047f6d01a3bd4a3ad2f70658edc26f36d82816537f9737a0/2000/), [Thai](https://wecomics.in.th/comics/19351/)",
